[D Quests for Onyxia's Lair \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 60 40man Onyxia]

Onyxia's Lair is a cave in the Wyrmbog, the dragon-haunted south of Dustwallow Marsh. Walk south through the marsh to the hills below Emberstrife's ledge; the lair mouth opens on the west side of the bog, at about 52.9,78.2 (Dungeon Quest Atlas; QuestieDB puts it at 52.6,76.8). You need the Drakefire Amulet from the attunement below to pass the door inside.

-- Left out, owned by other guides: 4903 Warlord's Command (Lower Blackrock Spire), 4941 Eitrigg's Wisdom and 4974 For The Horde! (Upper Blackrock Spire), 4182 to 4322, the Windsor chain up to Jail Break! (Blackrock Depths). This guide starts with the follow-ups.
-- Left out: 7490, 7491 and 7493 (Horde) and 7495, 7496 and 7497 (Alliance): the Head of Onyxia hand-ins after the kill, a drop for one raider. 7493 and 7497 also need Leatherworking 300. 7507 to 7509 Nostro's Compendium (Quel'Serrar): a rare Dire Maul book drop for warriors and paladins, one raider per kill (Questie hides it only from Wrath on, in LoadAutoBlacklistWotlk).

